::MODULE{FIELDS|title:每条优惠提取什么}
title price currency offer_url valid_until source_url fetched_at
::MODULE{SETTINGS|title:机器读取的明确配置}
::CONFIG{"locale":"en-US","currency":"USD","cron":"17 */6 * * *","stale_hours":30,"repository_url":"https://github.com/xyh2005-qq/vps-scout-promo-radar","deployment_status":"Public repository available; six-hour GitHub refresh configured; automatic Pages deployment pending"}
::MODULE{ADAPTERS|title:解析器和来源元数据}
::ADAPTER{"provider":"RackNerd","parser":"racknerd","kind":"special","currency":"USD","terms_url":"https://www.racknerd.com/affiliates-terms-of-service"}
::ADAPTER{"provider":"RamNode","parser":"ramnode","kind":"regular","currency":"USD","terms_url":""}
::ADAPTER{"provider":"GreenCloud","parser":"greencloud","kind":"special","currency":"USD","terms_url":""}
::ADAPTER{"provider":"CloudCone","parser":"cloudcone","kind":"regular","currency":"USD","terms_url":""}
::ADAPTER{"provider":"ServaRica","parser":"servarica","kind":"regular","currency":"USD","terms_url":""}
::ADAPTER{"provider":"VPSDime","parser":"vpsdime","kind":"regular","currency":"USD","terms_url":""}
::RULE{抓不到 price⇒这条不写 price 字段 也不写进结构化数据 不许拿估的填}
::RULE{valid_until 已过⇒下架; 抓取失败⇒移出有效列表; 超过 stale_hours⇒移出有效列表}
::RULE{每家先检查robots; 403或429停止; 不绕反爬; 价格和规格必须来自同一套餐块}
::RULE{只渲染PROVIDERS中的厂商; 常规价格不冒充折扣; 年付不得冒充月付; 不伪造库存}
::BOUNDARY{never:编优惠 编价格 编佣金 付费推理 自动发社交消息|scope:permanent}
